# Colfio engine work

This repo maintains the **Colfio miniengine** (PixiJS ECS layer). Extend the library; do not add game content to `src/`.

## Knowledge base

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/` before non-trivial changes. Prefer `docs/` over outdated `web-docs` for engine internals.

## Scope

- **In:** `src/engine`, `src/components`, `src/utils`, `tests/`, packaging, agent docs
- **Out (unless asked):** Matter/physics, aph-math, networking, audio, game factories — those belong in examples/libs

## Invariants

- Deferred `addComponent` vs immediate `addComponentAndRun`
- No `clearScene()` during update (`clearSceneAsync` / `callWithDelay(0, …)`)
- Message bus: no self-delivery; respect `expired` and `tagFilter`
- Do not use `_proxy` from game-level component code; use GameObject API
- Keep Builder fluent (`return this`); additive APIs preferred over renames

## Done checklist

Lint, Jest, `test:typescript`, build. Update `docs/` for public API changes.
